# AstralPlayer demo script for the Playground sample (see Tools/AstralPlayer.cpp).
# <frames> <keys held...> [| console command on the step's first frame]
30  -                          # settle
60  W                          # walk through the centre star
40  W D
1   W Space                    # jump
50  W
40  D Shift                    # sprint east
60  E                          # orbit the camera
1   -                          | spawn Crate 0 6 -2
90  -
